  "development_selection": "First predeclared A budget96/30000 yielded three known quantity fields and unresolved controls/drive/position/membership. Larger128/60000 and192/90000 were not tried. B learned a complete model from actual interventions. An old raw Program metadata export failure was preserved and the same cold case rerun with to_dict serialization only.",
  "initial_contract": "All streams start with empty knowledge. Only anonymous controls, bounds and sensor banks are exposed. A uses96 observations/30000 compute/1152 meter; B uses512/480000/6144. A is focus or event, while B is focus on the same apparatus and wiring with a new trajectory seed. No object partition, hidden formula, source hypothesis or candidate score is supplied.",
  "schedule_contract": "Finish all first visits before scheduled continuations. The shared total pool is exactly the sum of initial allowances. Restore prior purchased transitions, partial role alternatives and recorded experiments from JSON. A later object model can propose additional research, never automatically certify A's roles or response. Every source visit, screen, failed hypothesis and new measurement is charged. Keep roots without an opportunity.",
  "knowledge_ablation_contract": "The deletion arm performs A and B but its external session adapter does not screen successors or autonomously queue visits. Once the knowledge arm finishes it receives only the actual task revisit positions and incremental resource allocations. Resume with A's initial library and candidate=None; no new source model, experiment recipe, candidate or prediction is passed. Do not charge nonexistent screening. Clip the matched allocation by its own remaining total pool, without enlarging a visit because it saved screen compute. This is a given-schedule deletion of knowledge, not a vanilla agent.",
  "evaluation_contract": "Only after all cohort learning ends, score initial and final programs on identical4x48 random trajectories plus per-anonymous-control low/quarter/mid/three-quarter/high steps at one center and two independently sampled nonzero public-bound backgrounds. Every step sequence includes reset and return history; no true relation radius or role label constructs probes. Anonymous banks are not projectable: purchase each needed legal bank separately, derive commands from actual applied controls, and count all terminal resources. Report deployed initial/final channel costs separately. Both random and sweep MSE must be <=1e-6.",
  "role_evaluation_contract": "After prediction scoring, use the existing private evaluation_schema only to count correctly inferred quantity/drive/position/membership and control roles. Missing roles remain unresolved; no evaluator result enters the learned library or scheduler.",
  "baseline_serialization": "Frozen0.100 cognition is unchanged. The runner converts raw Program terms inside saved finalist metadata through Program.to_dict so existing reports can persist.",
  "scope": "Eight predeclared independent apparatus/name/wiring roots;3/4 objects byfocus/event has two roots per cell. Object and relation operator families remain predefined. Forty-eight initial visits plus actual revisits; all roots retained and no tuning on main outcomes.",
  "formal_evidence": false
